                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a576c91b-73cd-4565-a14d-c13cede082cd",
                                                "sense_id": "dd4d6379-b4ab-3d61-bd0a-0268b867f89e",
                                                "text": "Coordinate term: girlmode"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8234ca1-98d0-4498-84c9-9cc9f1d5ff31",
                                                "sense_id": "dd4d6379-b4ab-3d61-bd0a-0268b867f89e",
                                                "text": "I was out in semi-boymode tonight and some drunk Scottish guy walked up to me in the street and said \"Aye pal, you tryna become a lassie?\" I was just like \"Umm I guess\" super embarrassedly, and he said \"ah well good on ya, don't let nae cunt tell you who you are, be yoursel\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d176fe4-1ae1-4161-ac69-5a7a5b251d91",
                                                "sense_id": "dd4d6379-b4ab-3d61-bd0a-0268b867f89e",
                                                "text": "...just been told I look better in boymode..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02a6a1e7-6568-4e5a-8e4f-26d79475d6f3",
                                                "sense_id": "dd4d6379-b4ab-3d61-bd0a-0268b867f89e",
                                                "text": "Before I came out as trans I was in boymode at work and this girl came up to me and goes \"You're not fooling anyone\" I was like \"Huh?\" she goes \"You're one of them girls pretending to be a boy. I can see your tits and they're bigger than mine!\" I love accidental validation!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
