                                                "sense_id": "67898cf2-bb82-3569-842e-c7634ecdd31b",
                                                "text": "Coordinate term: girlmode"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d6bbb8f-6452-4217-af8d-4a87ec37e2c9",
                                                "sense_id": "67898cf2-bb82-3569-842e-c7634ecdd31b",
                                                "text": "We are 6 months away from cis girls posting that they're boymoding for not putting on makeup to go to the corner store"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "504dcc6e-a904-4ea8-92a8-700f5cd2011e",
                                                "sense_id": "67898cf2-bb82-3569-842e-c7634ecdd31b",
                                                "text": "you boymode because you feel insecure about your appearance, she boymodes to hijack a boeing 727-100 airplane, demand $200,000 in negotiable american currency and jump out the aft staircase, you are not the same"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3d7a4a8-39f3-430d-afce-e5d69e37054f",
                                                "sense_id": "67898cf2-bb82-3569-842e-c7634ecdd31b",
                                                "text": "Living authentically is addictive. So many trans people go full-time sooner than planned. Once they get a taste they can't go back. I boymoded 24/7 my first 15 months on HRT. Then I went out in a skirt ONCE. 4 months later I submitted my petition for legal name and gender change."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef439c14-2c95-47fa-8f0c-329dcd7482cb",
                                                "sense_id": "67898cf2-bb82-3569-842e-c7634ecdd31b",
                                                "text": "i dont boymode, i manmode"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "191427f5-73cd-4c0b-9d8e-35cf7ae40784",
                                                "sense_id": "67898cf2-bb82-3569-842e-c7634ecdd31b",
                                                "text": "when you're 6 months on HRT but still trying to boymode"
